UPDATE public.categories c SET hint = v.hint, page_intro = v.intro, meta_description = v.intro
FROM (VALUES
('fashion','Menswear, womenswear, knitwear, shoes, bags and accessories','Clothing seen the way it''s meant to be worn: in motion. Browse reels from tailors, knitters, designers and heritage houses, watch the drape, fit and fabric up close, then go straight to the maker. Filter by mood or season to find pieces that suit how you live.'),
('sports-outdoor','Ski, hike, ride, sail and train','Gear proven outside, not just in the studio. Watch down parkas, shells, boots and technical layers on mountains, coasts and trails, with weights, fills and features shown on screen. Find the kit that fits your sport, your season and the conditions you head into.'),
('jewelry-watches','Fine jewelry, everyday pieces and timepieces','Small pieces deserve a closer look. Reels show how metal catches light, how a chain sits and how a watch wears on the wrist. Discover goldsmiths, studios and watchmakers, from heirloom pieces to everyday favourites, and buy directly from the people who make them.'),
('beauty-fragrance','Skincare, body care, makeup and scent','See texture, colour and ritual before you buy. Browse reels of skincare, hand and body care, makeup and fragrance from apothecaries, labs and small-batch makers. Learn what''s inside, how it''s used and how it feels, then shop straight from the brand.'),
('home-living','Furniture, objects, textiles and tableware','Rooms, objects and the details that make a home. Watch furniture, ceramics, lighting, linens and tableware in real spaces, so you can judge scale, finish and light. Discover studios and workshops whose style matches yours, and buy directly from them.'),
('crafts-making','Yarn, patterns, tools and materials','For people who make things. Browse reels of yarns, patterns, fabrics, tools and kits, with finished projects shown in motion. See the stitch, the colour and the result before you start, then get the materials and instructions straight from the designer or shop.'),
('food-drink','Producers, restaurants, cafés, wine and spirits','Taste starts with seeing. Watch producers, bakers, roasters, winemakers, distillers, restaurants and cafés at work, from the field to the plate or glass. Find something to order home or a table to book, and discover the people behind what you eat and drink.'),
('wellness','Movement, rest, care and studios','Ways to feel better, shown honestly. Browse reels from yoga and movement studios, spas, practitioners and wellness brands, with real spaces, real routines and real products. Find the care, class or ritual that fits your pace, and connect with them directly.'),
('travel-stays','Hotels, retreats, guided trips and experiences','Places you can almost step into. Watch reels from hotels, guesthouses, retreats and tour makers, with rooms, views and experiences as they really look. Compare settings and moods, then book with the host directly instead of through a middleman.'),
('kids-family','Clothing, toys, nursery and family goods','Thoughtful things for children and the people who raise them. Browse reels of clothing, toys, nursery pieces and family essentials, made to last and to be handed down. See materials and sizing in motion, then shop straight from the makers.'),
('pets','Gear, food, beds and care for animals','Well-made things for the animals you live with. Watch reels of collars, leads, beds, bowls, food and grooming from brands that design for pets first. See how each piece fits, holds up and looks at home, then buy directly from the maker.'),
('art-photography','Prints, originals, photography and studios','Art you can see being made. Browse reels from painters, printmakers, photographers and galleries, with process, scale and framing shown up close. Find originals and editions for your walls, and buy directly from the artist or studio.'),
('local-services','Studios, ateliers, repairs and appointments','Skilled people near you. Watch reels from tailors, florists, repairers, designers and other service studios showing their work and their space. See the quality before you book, then contact or schedule with them directly.'),
('nonprofit-events','Charities, causes, festivals and fundraisers','Stories worth showing up for. Watch reels from charities, humanitarian groups, festivals and fundraisers, with the people, places and moments behind the work. See what each organisation does and where help goes, then donate, volunteer or get tickets directly.')
) AS v(slug, hint, intro)
WHERE c.slug = v.slug;